        "text_W4YYQp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Join Anita for a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to shift your perspective and step fully into your spiritual power.</strong></p><p>Anita Moorjani, known for her profound insights into the nature of existence and the afterlife, will guide you on this adventurous 5-day spiritual and mystical treasure hunt retreat at the Arkansas crystal mines. The aim of this retreat is to help you facilitate a deeper connection with the unseen world that lies “beyond the veil”. Anita has purposefully designed this event to offer a transformative experience amidst the serene and energetically charged environment of the crystal mines, where you will be led to connect with your spiritual guides. You will enjoy a unique blend of spiritual exploration, self-discovery, and deep healing in a safe and gentle environment.</p><p><strong>Have you ever felt the pull of something greater? </strong>A sense that there’s more to life than what meets the eye - a hidden world just waiting to be discovered? Imagine stepping into a space where the ordinary melts away, and the veil between worlds begins to thin.</p><p>A space where healing flows freely, clarity takes root, and the whispers of the unseen world guide you toward your highest self. </p><p>This is the magical energy of the crystal mines that I want to share with you. </p><p>Let’s open the door together - even if it’s just a crack - and <strong>uncover the treasures that lie within you.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_WwyKKQ",
        "text_W4YYQp"
