            "heading_size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "sales_point_HXDETX": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Deepened Spiritual Awareness:</strong> Through experiential meditative journeys that delve into spiritual realms, these guided experiences led by Anita’s calm voice, will give you the rare opportunity to connect with higher dimensions of consciousness and gain clarity on your spiritual path. You will learn to access and interpret messages from beyond, enhancing your understanding of your own spiritual essence and purpose."
          }
        },
        "sales_point_ER7mGj": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Enhanced Healing and Self-Discovery:</strong> The retreat incorporates various healing modalities designed to facilitate personal transformation. By engaging in meditation and other spiritual practices amidst the powerful energy of the crystal mines, you will have the opportunity to release past traumas, overcome limiting beliefs, and heal emotional wounds. The retreat environment, rich in crystal energy, supports this healing process, allowing for profound breakthroughs and self-discovery."
          }
        },
        "sales_point_pHF9LF": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Receiving Messages From the Other Side:</strong> Prior to the start of the retreat, participants will receive a workbook (created by Anita Moorjani) that will guide you to look for messages from spirit. Throughout the retreat, you will be prompted and encouraged to look for and interpret signs and communication from “the other side”."
          }
        },
        "sales_point_f6UN4t": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Practical Tools for Daily Life:</strong> In addition to mystical experiences, you will learn practical tools and techniques for integrating your spiritual insights into everyday life. Anita’s teachings emphasize the importance of applying spiritual knowledge in practical ways, helping participants cultivate a more meaningful and fulfilling life. Learning to bridge both realms (the physical and the non-physical) empowers you to create lasting and positive changes."
          }
        },
        "sales_point_3w9Xze": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Unique Experience of Crystal Energy:</strong> The Arkansas crystal mines provide a distinctive backdrop for this retreat. The energy of the crystals and the natural beauty of the surroundings create a sacred space conducive to profound spiritual experiences. You will definitely benefit from the unique vibrational qualities of the crystals, which can amplify their meditation and healing processes."
          }
        },
        "sales_point_DyY8cH": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Personal Empowerment and Clarity:</strong> By engaging in the spiritual practices and teachings offered at the retreat, you will gain greater clarity about your life’s purpose and direction. This newfound clarity can lead to enhanced personal empowerment, helping you make more informed and aligned decisions in your life."
          }
        },
        "sales_point_3gPny4": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "icon": "checkmark-no-circle",
            "icon_color": "#01b4b4",
            "text": "<strong>Community and Support:</strong> The retreat offers a supportive community of like-minded individuals who share a passion for spiritual growth and exploration. You will have the opportunity to connect deeply with others on similar journeys, fostering lasting friendships and networks of support. This sense of community can be incredibly affirming and inspiring, enhancing the overall retreat experience."
          }
        },
