            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Venue: Arlington Resort Hotel & Spa",
            "text": "<p>The historic Arlington Resort Hotel & Spa is the largest hotel in Arkansas. It is a smoke-free facility. Since 1875 The Arlington has been hosting guests as one of the South’s premiere resorts … truly an American Treasure. From our grand hotel lobby and famous bar, to our elegant Venetian Dining Room, to the beautiful Crystal Ballroom, The Arlington has everything you’d want in a historic hotel … and more. And at The Arlington there is our top-rated Hot Springs Spa and Salon, and our Thermal Bathhouse, where you will bathe in the famous mineral waters of the ‘hot springs’.</p><p>Outside the front door is the National Park’s famed Bathhouse Row and a grand stroll through history and beauty. Across the street are museums, antique and art galleries, unique restaurants and live entertainment.<br/>There is only one Hot Springs and at its heart is The Arlington Resort Hotel & Spa.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>Special Group Rates per Room per Night:</strong><br/>Range of rooms block dates: April 9-15, 2025<br/>Name of event: SHALOHA<br/>Rooms are on Run-of-House basis.<br/>Breakfast is not included.</p><p><strong>King/Double Standard Room:</strong><br/>$108.00 Single occupancy<br/>$110.00 Double occupancy<br/>$128.00 Triple occupancy<br/>$138.00 Quad occupancy<br/><br/>Book your room to arrive on Wednesday April 9th, and depart on Tuesday April 15th.</p><p>– To <a href=\"https://link/\">book your room online</a>, please go to this page:<br/><a href=\"https://reseze.net/servlet/SendPage?hotelid=1624&skipfirstpage=true&page=404385\" target=\"_blank\">reseze.net/servlet/SendPage?hotelid=1624&skipfirstpage=true&page=404385</a><br/>*If there are no rooms available in our block online, please let us know at <a href=\"mailto:info@shalohaproductions.com\">info@shalohaproductions.com</a> and will add more.</p><p>- To book your room by phone, please contact 501-609-2533 or 1-800-643-1502 and ask for the “SHALOHA GROUP” rate. A credit card is required to secure your room. For questions email: <a href=\"mailto:info@arlingtonhotel.com\">info@arlingtonhotel.com</a></p><p>– Room rates quoted are net, non-commissionable and are subject to tax and fees. The current room tax is 14.5% and a resort fee of $15.00 per room night will apply (tax & fees are subject to change). For all rooms, there is a $15.00 charge for each additional person in the room.</p><p>– All reservations must be guaranteed by a major credit card, a first night’s room deposit plus tax. Individual room cancellations must be received 24 hours prior to arrival to avoid a charge of one night’s room and tax.</p><p>– To secure your room with our Group Rate, make your reservation by March 9, 2025. After that date, it is subject to availability with our Group Rate.</p><p>– Check-in time is 3:00 pm. Check-out time is 11:00 am.</p><p></p>",
